From: Arthur Souza Rodrigues <arthursrodrigues@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:15:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] docs(agents): jubarte-documents skill and the Acme letter
 plan example

The skill replaces the pandoc/soffice/pdftoppm paths of the docx skill with
jubarte text/inspect, jubarte edit, jubarte convert --png/--report and
jubarte accept, keeps the docx-js creation footguns, and lists the gotchas
that survive the redesign (unique anchors, run-format inheritance, plain
run text, opaque ranges, compare-based redlines, renderer balloon gap,
missing merge/format operations). The example is the hand-rolled
redline.py workflow as one plan, with its actual report and rendered page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XSguJyaPYNYbKNxFYkEmvV
